{"id":"ccb159b85de6c3b6","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-mgu.md","title":"df-mgu","display":"df-mgu — df-mgu","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-mgu","aliases":["57-df-mgu"],"display":"df-mgu — df-mgu","depends_on":["[[57-df-substitution]]","[[57-df-substitution-application]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-mgu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-mgu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mgu — df-mgu"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2\\)</span> 为有限等式问题；单个输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 同为项或同为原子式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\">\\(\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\)</span> 为候选代换。项、原子式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>。</li>\n<li>代换与域外恒等延拓见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a>，其应用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a>。</li>\n<li>当前符号语法有固定有效编码，并固定一个单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(c:\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span> 作为选择顺序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>。该参数一经固定不随输入选择，不从多个最一般合一子中临时选值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\\)</span> 是下述谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\)</span> 为下述定义域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mgu}:D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{mgu}:D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\)</span> 保留原术语表的单个代换返回接口，而不是返回代换集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\land\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;s\\theta=t\\theta,\\\\\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\sigma,E)\\to\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\n\\widehat\\sigma(x)=\\widehat\\theta(x)\\delta\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,\\{(s,t)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\land\\forall(s,t)\\in E\\;s\\theta=t\\theta,\\\\\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,E)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,E)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\sigma,E)\\to\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\n\\widehat\\sigma(x)=\\widehat\\theta(x)\\delta\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,\\{(s,t)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(s,t)\\in D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\quad\n\\mathrm{mgu}(s,t)=\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{MGU}(\\eta,s,t)\\to c(\\theta)\\leq c(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(s,t)\\in D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\quad\n\\mathrm{mgu}(s,t)=\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MGU}(\\theta,s,t)\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{MGU}(\\eta,s,t)\\to c(\\theta)\\leq c(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2\\quad\n(s,t)\\in D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,\\{(s,t)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^2\\cup\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^2\\quad\n(s,t)\\in D_{\\mathrm{mgu}}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;\\mathrm{Unifier}(\\theta,\\{(s,t)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据原56引用处的最一般合一用途在57内部补齐，并保留小写 mgu 返回单个代换的调用。非空自然数码集有最小元，编码单射保证所选值唯一；不可合一输入上不定义值。最后一式是有限一阶合一的存在性事实：按同首符号分解、删除同一项、定向变量等式并经出现检查消元，失败当且仅当不存在合一子，成功时每步保留实例分解性质。没有提供56原文，故此条是按接口重建，不声称逐字迁移。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]